{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Welcome to the YesterSol Demo Page!</i> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What's in the DEMO?</strong>\u00a0 </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore the first 2 areas, and face off against their enemies and bosses!\u00a0 These 2 areas, have a variety of secrets, enemies, and challenges to overcome! The full game will include 17+ areas!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the 12 Demo Shards to see a special area!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939220/extras/60185ac884ea39a93f72288f7cf69f51.avif?t=1755317912\" width=577 height=66 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>ABOUT YESTERSOL:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use a magical SolSpear!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it as a platform!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recall it back!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn into a seed to roll through small places!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport to it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939220/extras/374591ee3a4c8f40affe94db27b97683.poster.avif?t=1755317912\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939220/extras/374591ee3a4c8f40affe94db27b97683.webm?t=1755317912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939220/extras/374591ee3a4c8f40affe94db27b97683.mp4?t=1755317912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on an epic journey as Corin</strong>, a young Soladin\u2014a sun warrior in training. Armed with a magical SolSpear that doubles as a throw-able weapon and platform to stand on, you venture into a cursed land destroyed by Culex, an ancient evil once imprisoned in the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the origin of monstrous mosquito minions</strong> that ravaged your town, determined to prevent such devastation again. Journey into an ancient underground city sustained by a HeatSeed, generating endless steam. This city was once part of the SolLuna Kingdom, torn apart by a civil war born from differing beliefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate through the remnants of this kingdom, battle foes, and explore the ancient city</strong> to unearth a solution and numerous secrets. The fate of your people rests on your shoulders as you confront the shadows of a fractured past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939220/extras/a4e6dd5d3a28cf4c9aec54a71e168b49.poster.avif?t=1755317912\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939220/extras/a4e6dd5d3a28cf4c9aec54a71e168b49.webm?t=1755317912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939220/extras/a4e6dd5d3a28cf4c9aec54a71e168b49.mp4?t=1755317912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939220/extras/641c6a78a33f955c4bc1ac70de643892.avif?t=1755317912\" width=577 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939220?t=1755317912","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939220?t=1755317912","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939220/f3ed7feba7aa9fb8e92497ba74ab7a7854850893/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755317912","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939220/f3ed7feba7aa9fb8e92497ba74ab7a7854850893/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755317912","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Welcome to the YesterSol Demo Page!</i> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What's in the DEMO?</strong>\u00a0 </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore the first 2 areas, and face off against their enemies and bosses!\u00a0 These 2 areas, have a variety of secrets, enemies, and challenges to overcome! The full game will include 17+ areas!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the 12 Demo Shards to see a special area!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939220/extras/60185ac884ea39a93f72288f7cf69f51.avif?t=1755317912\" width=577 height=66 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>ABOUT YESTERSOL:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use a magical SolSpear!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it as a platform!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recall it back!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn into a seed to roll through small places!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport to it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla